# video_eleven_labs_chrome_extension

Created: August 5, 2025 3:10 AM
Update: August 16, 2025 4:26 PM
status: Done

We've all been there: you open YouTube out of habit to relax, but end up mindlessly scrolling. It's a problem created by the platform's design.

To fix this, I developed a Chrome extension. Before you see the feed, a widget asks: "What is your real intention?", offering alternatives that truly recharge you.

The result is simple: this old habit is little by little replaced by a conscious choice, so that your state is intentional and motivated by your own interest.

